# Qwen3.6-27B NVFP4 no-subnormal ceiling KLD (200 chunks, wikitext-2 test, c=512)

Base: qwen3.6-27b-f16-kld-base.dat  (f16, -ngl 28 partial offload)
Final f16 PPL = 6.7988 +/- 0.07550

## Step 1 - UE4M3 subnormal-scale stats (scripts/nvfp4-subnormal-stats.py)
qwen3.6-27b-nvfp4.gguf: 99.94% of 1.63e9 micro-scale codes subnormal.
decoded scale: min_nz 9.77e-4, median 2.93e-3, p99.9 6.84e-3 (largest subnormal), max 0.117.
=> the 3-bit-mantissa normal grid is essentially unused; per-16 scale is a 7-level log grid.
N feasible [3, 10.9]; chose N=6 (encode *64, decode *2^-6).

